  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"card\">\n  <h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"left\">Left number</label>\n    <input id=\"left\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"e.g. -5\" aria-label=\"Left number\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n    <select id=\"operation\" aria-label=\"Operation\">\n      <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n      <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n      <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n      <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n    </select>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"field\">\n    <label for=\"right\">Right number</label>\n    <input id=\"right\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" placeholder=\"e.g. 3\" aria-label=\"Right number\">\n  </div>\n  <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n  <output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n</main>\n<script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #2c2f4a;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --error: #ff6b6b;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #000;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 16px;\n}\nh1 {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n.field {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\nlabel {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\ninput, select, button {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  background: #0f1020;\n  color: var(--text);\n  border-radius: 0;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n  outline: 3px solid #fff;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\nbutton {\n  cursor: pointer;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #1a1c2c;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #000;\n}\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #ffe08a;\n}\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(2px, 2px);\n  box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000;\n}\n#result {\n  display: block;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  padding: 12px;\n  background: #0f1020;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  min-height: 3.5rem;\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n#result.error {\n  color: var(--error);\n}\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.25rem; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const leftInput = document.getElementById('left');\nconst rightInput = document.getElementById('right');\nconst operationSelect = document.getElementById('operation');\nconst calculateBtn = document.getElementById('calculate');\nconst resultOutput = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction showError() {\n  resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n  resultOutput.classList.add('error');\n}\n\nfunction showResult(value) {\n  resultOutput.textContent = String(value);\n  resultOutput.classList.remove('error');\n}\n\nfunction calculate() {\n  const leftRaw = leftInput.value.trim();\n  const rightRaw = rightInput.value.trim();\n\n  if (leftRaw === '' || rightRaw === '') {\n    showError();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const left = Number(leftRaw);\n  const right = Number(rightRaw);\n\n  if (!Number.isFinite(left) || !Number.isFinite(right)) {\n    showError();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  const op = operationSelect.value;\n  let result;\n\n  switch (op) {\n    case 'add':\n      result = left + right;\n      break;\n    case 'subtract':\n      result = left - right;\n      break;\n    case 'multiply':\n      result = left * right;\n      break;\n    case 'divide':\n      if (right === 0) {\n        showError();\n        return;\n      }\n      result = left / right;\n      break;\n    default:\n      showError();\n      return;\n  }\n\n  if (!Number.isFinite(result)) {\n    showError();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  showResult(result);\n}\n\ncalculateBtn.addEventListener('click', calculate);\n\n[leftInput, rightInput, operationSelect].forEach((el) => {\n  el.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n    if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      calculate();\n    }\n  });\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nA tiny offline calculator with a pixel-art look. Enter two numbers, pick an operation, and press **Calculate**. The result area shows only the numeric answer, or the exact text `Error` when the input is invalid.\n\n## Features\n\n- Two number inputs: `left` and `right` (negative values supported)\n- Operations: add, subtract, multiply, divide\n- Pressing **Enter** in any input or the select triggers calculation\n- Rejects empty inputs, non-finite numbers, and division by zero with the exact text `Error`\n- Output starts at `0` and contains no labels\n- Fully offline: no packages, no network requests, no storage, no inline event handlers\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure and required IDs\n- `style.css` – pixel theme, responsive layout, focus/hover/pressed states\n- `script.js` – validation and calculation logic\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a value in **Left number** and **Right number**.\n3. Choose an operation from the dropdown.\n4. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter).\n\nThe result appears in the large output area. If the input is invalid, the output shows `Error`.\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All controls have visible labels and are keyboard accessible.\n- Focus, hover, and pressed states are clearly visible.\n- Layout works from 360px wide.\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
